# The development image only pre-builds a small manifest subset. Keep the
# context allowlisted so generated bindings, native modules, vendor sources,
# and local build outputs are never transferred to the daemon.
**
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!docker/
!docker/Dockerfile.dev
!marty-crypto/
!marty-crypto/Cargo.toml
!marty-verification/
!marty-verification/Cargo.toml
!marty-secure-storage/
!marty-secure-storage/Cargo.toml
!marty-biometrics/
!marty-biometrics/Cargo.toml
